#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:3
msgid "Address Book"
msgstr "Agenda"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:5
msgid ""
"Virtual PBX clients have access to a simple Address book to store contacts, "
"that can be used for third party integrations."
msgstr ""
"Los clientes de PBX virtual tienen acceso a una agenda simple para almacenar"
" contactos, que se puede usar para integraciones de terceros."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:8
msgid ""
"Contacts for vPBX users are automatically created and managed by the system,"
" but client administrators can add other external numbers to existing "
"contacts."
msgstr ""
"Los contactos para los usuarios de vPBX son creados y gestionados "
"automáticamente por el sistema, pero los administradores del cliente pueden "
"agregar otros números externos a los contactos existentes."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:13
msgid "Personal data"
