msgid "Required"
msgstr "Obligatoria"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:58
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "Notas"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:59
msgid "``id``"
msgstr "``id``"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:60
#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:66
#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:69
#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:72
#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:76
#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:79
msgid "No"
msgstr "No"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:61
msgid ""
"With a value, the contact with that id is updated. Empty or missing, a new "
"contact is created."
msgstr ""
"Con valor, se actualiza el contacto con ese id. Vacía o ausente, se crea un "
"contacto nuevo."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:62
msgid "``name``"
msgstr "``name``"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:63
msgid "To create"
msgstr "Al crear"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:64
msgid "Cannot be left empty. Up to 100 characters."
msgstr "No puede quedar vacío. Máximo 100 caracteres."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:65
msgid "``lastname``"
msgstr "``lastname``"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:67
msgid "Up to 100 characters."
msgstr "Máximo 100 caracteres."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:68
msgid "``email``"
msgstr "``email``"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:70
msgid "Valid email address. Up to 100 characters."
msgstr "Dirección de email válida. Máximo 100 caracteres."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:71
msgid "``workPhoneCountry``, ``mobilePhoneCountry``"
msgstr "``workPhoneCountry``, ``mobilePhoneCountry``"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:73
msgid ""
"ISO country code (for example ``ES``). When there is a phone and no country,"
" the client country is used."
msgstr ""
"Código ISO del país (por ejemplo ``ES``). Si hay teléfono y no hay país, se "
"usa el país del cliente."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:75
msgid "``workPhone``, ``mobilePhone``"
msgstr "``workPhone``, ``mobilePhone``"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:77
msgid "Number without international prefix. Up to 20 characters."
msgstr "Número sin prefijo internacional. Máximo 20 caracteres."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:78
msgid "``otherPhone``"
msgstr "``otherPhone``"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:80
msgid "Free text. Up to 25 characters."
msgstr "Texto libre. Máximo 25 caracteres."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:83
msgid "Example CSV file"
msgstr "Fichero CSV de ejemplo"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:91
msgid "The import follows these rules:"
msgstr "La importación sigue estas reglas:"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:93
msgid ""
"A row without id always creates a new contact, even if an identical one "
"already exists."
msgstr ""
"Una fila sin id siempre crea un contacto nuevo, aunque ya exista uno "
"idéntico."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:94
msgid ""
"A row with id updates that contact. If the id does not exist or belongs to "
"another client, the row fails."
msgstr ""
"Una fila con id actualiza ese contacto. Si el id no existe o pertenece a "
"otro cliente, la fila falla."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:95
msgid ""
"A column present in the header but empty in a row deletes the value of that "
"field."
msgstr ""
"Una columna presente en la cabecera pero vacía en una fila borra el valor de"
" ese campo."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:96
msgid "A column missing from the header is not modified when updating."
msgstr "Una columna que no está en la cabecera no se modifica al actualizar."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:97
msgid ""
"Contacts linked to a user only update their phones and phone countries: "
"name, lastname, email and other phone are ignored, as they are kept in sync "
"with the user."
msgstr ""
"Los contactos vinculados a un usuario solo actualizan sus teléfonos y sus "
"países: el nombre, los apellidos, el email y el otro teléfono se ignoran, ya"
" que se mantienen sincronizados con el usuario."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:99
msgid ""
"Valid rows are saved and failed rows are reported with their line number in "
"the file and the reason."
msgstr ""
"Las filas válidas se guardan y las erróneas se informan con su número de "
"línea en el fichero y el motivo."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:101
msgid ""
"Import again only the failed lines once fixed. Importing the whole file "
"again would duplicate the contacts created from rows without id."
msgstr ""
"Una vez corregidas, importa de nuevo solo las líneas fallidas. Importar otra"
" vez el fichero completo duplicaría los contactos creados desde filas sin "
"id."
